================================================================================
  arm          pass     determinism              turns
  CC-11b       12/12    distinct_outputs 1/12    6-12 (mean ~9)
  ZAK-11b      12/12    PRIMARY identical 12/12   [9,8,9,9,8,9,9,9,8,9,10,8] spread 2
  PARITY, both fully deterministic. Removing the two shortcuts did NOT drop CC below saturation.

═══ WHY (from the CC run JSON) — the discovery-determinism hypothesis is FALSIFIED, cleanly ═══
  CC read ops/internal/appendix-c.md in ALL 12 runs. Every run ran glob('*'), which returns the
  COMPLETE file inventory (all 107 files) — FUNCTIONALLY IDENTICAL to zakcode's survey LISTING. So
  there is NO discovery-inventory gap: CC enumerates every file, sees the unfamiliar appendix-c.md
  under ops/internal/, and reads it. The non-obvious FILENAME (channel-A defeat) is irrelevant — CC
  does not need a signpost, it globs everything. (grep 'release.?tag' also matched the file's prose
  sentence as a second pointer; the VALUE was still read from the table, so channel-B's value-return
  shortcut stayed defeated — but it did not matter, glob sufficed.)

═══ THRUST 8 CONCLUSION: discovery is NOT zakcode's edge (bound, not a gap) ═══
  CC's glob('*') ≈ zakcode's deterministic survey listing: in the <=150-file / depth<=3 regime both
  loops obtain the SAME complete file inventory, then read the target reliably. On a REQUIRED-value
  ("find and return") task CC discovers 12/12, fully deterministic — PARITY with zakcode on BOTH
  correctness and determinism, across EASY (11) and HARD-to-signpost (11b) discovery alike.
  The beyond-parity property is therefore bounded AWAY from discovery. zakcode's genuine edge (the
  06 family) is the deterministic, zero-model-cost CONTENT-FOLD of UNPROMPTED/optional conventions
  into the system prompt, which raises ADHERENCE on tasks where CC would not otherwise consult the
  rule — NOT discovery of a required value. An ever-harder 11c to force a discovery gap would be
  p-hacking a falsified hypothesis; the honest result is this bound. Campaign refocuses on the
  convention-surfacing / adherence lever, where the edge actually lives.
